SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Thursday May 7th) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us **on zoom** for a fun\, relaxing and inspiring evening with
  **Love Songs that Stir the Soul.**\n\nSongs that I have written for well 
 over 36 years.\nYou will love what you hear! :)\nWonderful new songs every
  week!\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time after 8:30 pm (Eastern Ti
 me)\n\\*You are also welcome to come on later in the evening as well\n**\\
 *\\*Attend for free if you like - if it's your first time attending :)**\n
 \nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Songwriter/Produ
 cer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the S
 oul (Thursday May 7th)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*Original Lyrics and Songs by
  Songwriter and Producer Steve Flemming\n\n\\*Story songs\, love songs\, s
 piritual songs\, songs about nature\, our culture\, our past\, our future\
 , relationships and our lives\n\nI'll be playing a mix of songs using a fu
 sion of mixed genres like\, **Folk\, Traditional Folk\, Country\, Blue Gra
 ss\, Singer Song Writer\, Soft Rock\, Easy Listening\, Classic Rock\, R & 
 B\, Gospel\, Pop\, Adult Contemporary\, Indie Rock/Po**p and many others g
 enres too. So please sit back and get ready to have an amazing auditory ex
 perience in the comforts of your own home :)\n\n\\*You can come on and off
  at any time during the night- starting at 8:30 pm\n\n**About Steve Flemmi
 ng:**\nHighly influenced by the great singer songwriters of the 50s\, 60s\
 , 70s\, 80s and 90s. I have been writing my own songs since 1990. Songs ab
 out life\, love\, loss\, hope\, faith\, joy\, romance\, memories\, spiritu
 ality and heartbreak. Songs that are universal\, heartfelt and often relev
 ant to the lives of many others.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:
 **\n\n**Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e trans
 fer or pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can con
 tribute is greatly appreciated to help support this meaningful musical end
 eavor and song loving community\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\n\nhttps://us04web.zo
 om.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Testimonials from Past Events:**\nYour songs are wonder-f
 ull\, speak to emotions\, experiences and moments we've all felt and lived
 . S. B.\nSteve Flemming is an amazing songwriter whose lyrics stir the sou
 l. He transforms everyday thoughts and life into beautiful poetry and magi
 cal tunes. Amazing stuff yet again Steve. - L.L.\nSteve\, thank you for a 
 night of heartfelt\, exhilarating\, and inspiring music.\nV.R.\nThanks for
  having me my friend. I love your words\, they calm me and energize me at 
 the same time I'll look forward to your next invite\nM.Z.\nThese great son
 gs definitely helped me to decompress after a long day. Keep up the song w
 riting Steve\, these are great! - S.S.\nThank you so much for a relaxing e
 vening and sharing your inspiring music Steve! I am excited to hear more a
 nd I hope you do this again!! - C.B\nLovely songs and a great vibe with wo
 nderful people. I couldn’t have asked for a better way to close my day. 
 Huge thanks Steve\, for inviting me! I truly enjoyed every moment! - N.A.\
 nThe lyrics are amazing. From the heart...\nThanks Steve for the amazing t
 unes. I'm truly blown away. Very glad I joined.\n\\- E\\.E\\.\n\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-
