SUMMARY:LAW OF ATTRACTION: (Live a Life with Greater Peace\, Joy and Abund
 ance)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for an inspiring\, interactive and insightful afternoon as 
 we continue to move closer to living the life we wish to live using the am
 azing and miraculous **Law of Attraction.**\n\nWe're going to have a lot o
 f fun too!\n\n\\*Joined by my other personal growth and social groups too\
 ; so we can anticipate a terrific turn out\, with wonderful like minded pe
 ople\n\n**Date:**\nSunday\, May 10th\, 2026\n**Arrival Time:**\nArrive bet
 ween 4:00 pm and 4:30 pm\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location: La Carnita - 
 Good Fortune Bar (Main Floor)**\n**Address:** 130 Eglinton Ave. Toronto\, 
 ON M4P 2X9\n**Free Parking:** on Eglinton and Residential area\n**Yonge an
 d Eglinton Subway:** (Very close\, 3 minute walking distance)\n\nEvent Det
 ails below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n\\-\\-\\
 -\nEvent Details:\n**LAW OF ATTRACTION: (Live a Life with Greater Peace\, 
 Joy and Abundance)**\n\n-Take your life to the next level with increased c
 larity\, joy\, fulfillment\, abundance and peace\n-Deepen your understandi
 ng on how to apply the **Law of Attraction** so it works in all areas of y
 our life (Personal\, Professional\, Social & Romantic)\n-Develop your conf
 idence and sense of self so you are more open to receive what the universe
  wants to give you\n-Tap into your inner source of passions\, talents and 
 creativity that will guide you to a life beyond your wildest imagination *
 (And then ask the Universe for even more!)*\n\n\\*Interactive\, inspiring 
 and insightful afternoon designed to help you live the life you truly desi
 re and truly deserve to live (with greater flow\, energy\, ease and purpos
 e)\n\n\\*This event will be effectively facilitated with powerful insights
 \, useful tools\, practical exercises and group participation\n\n\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n***Our Instructor/
 Facilitator:***\n**Steve Flemming** is the founder of **Soul City Social C
 lub since 2006.** He produces monthly events on subjects involving persona
 l/spiritual growth\, modern dating and healthy relationships while incorpo
 rating the **Law of Attraction and other useful tools.** Each event is des
 igned to help you experience greater joy\, inner peace\, confidence\, fulf
 illment\, love\, meaning and aliveness in our lives. Steve is a profession
 al group Facilitator and Inspirational Speaker. Steve has an ongoing passi
 on to help shift people's lives and consciousness for the better in areas 
 that matter most to you.\nhttps://www.meetup.com/SoulCity/\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\n**When to arrive: (Ask for Steve when you arrive-or head to back area
 )**\n-Please arrive between 4:00 pm and 4:30 pm (to get registered and set
 tled in)\n-The formal part of the afternoon will start shortly after 4:30 
 p.m. and go until roughly 6:30 p.m.\n-Stick around after for more mingling
  and our dinner party (optional)\n\\*no extra charge for attending the din
 ner party event\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 dollars upon arrival (HST i
 ncluded)\n(Cash only when you arrive or in advance by e transfer to- steve
 flemming11@gmail.com\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\\*Lunch/Dinner & Beverage Menu avai
 lable too\n\\*Includes reserved seating for the group\n\\*At least one Bev
 erage and/or appetizer minimum to support the staff and venue\n\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Parking Avai
 lable:**\n\\*Plenty of free street parking on Eglinton and (Residential ar
 ea south/east of venue for free)\n**Close to Subway Station:**\n\\*Also ve
 ry close to the the Yonge/Eglinton subway station\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
